        "receiverDescription": "These organisations are national or regional authorities in charge of developing and implementing science, technology, and innovation (STI) policies. Within the POLICY ANSWERS project, they acted as receivers of technical support, coordination tools, and capacity-building activities designed to harmonize R&I systems in the Western Balkans with the European Research Area (ERA). Key areas included policy co-creation, monitoring and evaluation frameworks, and support for digital transformation and green transition in STI policy.",
