        "challengeDescription": "The initial situation: The Western Balkans faced fragmented research and innovation (R&I) systems, limited integration into the European Research Area (ERA), and challenges in policy coordination across different sectors. | The challenge faced: Need for enhanced policy dialogue, capacity building, and alignment with EU priorities to foster stability, prosperity, and integration into EU frameworks.",
        "mainResultsSummary": "POLICY ANSWERS is fostering the establishment of structured policy dialogues, including ministerial and steering platform meetings. | Conduction of analytical activities such as mapping institutions and monitoring ERA integration progress. | Implementation of capacity-building programs tailored to national needs. | Launching of pilot activities to strengthen academia-industry links and researcher mobility. | Development of an information hub to facilitate knowledge sharing and stakeholder engagement. | Potential transferability to further organisations: The methodologies and tools developed can be adapted to other regions seeking to enhance R&I policy coordination and integration into broader research areas",
