        "providerDescription": "ÖSB Consulting GmbH is one of Austria's leading consulting firms, specialising in innovative concepts, counselling programmes, and pilot projects for the evolving work environment. The company operates internationally, tailoring solutions to regional needs, and is part of the ÖSB Group, Austria's largest independent provider of labour market services. Their services encompass management consulting, personnel consulting, organisational development, and coaching for executives.",
