        "mainResultsSummary": "Planning & Implementation: The SYNECOTEC system was integrated at Salzburg Regional Hospitals, capturing waste heat from cooling systems and redirecting it for heating and hot water supply. | Consequences and tangible results: Significant improvement in energy efficiency, reduction in greenhouse gas emissions, and operational cost savings. The project won the Austrian Environmental Award 2023 for its innovation and impact. | Potential transferability: The heat recovery model is scalable and transferable to other hospitals and large buildings in Austria and beyond.",
