        "receiverDescription": "The City of Lucerne is the municipal authority responsible for local governance, social policy, and public services. In the context of Luzern60plus, it plays a key role in shaping and implementing age-inclusive policies, engaging senior citizens in civic dialogue, and enhancing active aging.",
