        "providerCity": "Zurich (coordination), national coverage",
        "providerDescription": "In the SHIFT Flagship project (Smart Hospital: Integrated Framework, Tools & Solutions), funded by Innosuisse, we—5 implementation partners, 24 partners from industry and practice, and around 20 hospitals—are working together to transform the Swiss healthcare system. The focus is on developing integrated technical and organizational solutions that put people at the center. The goal is to create a blueprint for the digital transformation of the smart & liquid hospital of the future. | At the kickoff event, we presented and discussed the project’s objectives, including improving quality and efficiency through innovative technologies such as artificial intelligence and connected systems. In addition, the first steps and to-dos for the involved partners were defined in order to lay the foundation for a successful collaboration over the next 3.5 years.",
